+## Session start failure
+
+If `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, `processMessage` rejects with that same error, calls `onError(session, error)` before `afterSession(session)`, and starts no later turn phase; `afterSession` must tolerate setup that stopped partway through and release only resources that were acquired ([validated by: rejects with the original error and runs onError before afterSession for a partial session](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L9)).
